-widest text-xs transition-all transform hover:scale-105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        WhatsApp Technician\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:block\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/20\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Air-cooler-repair-service-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Professional air cooler repair services daman\" class=\"rounded-2xl mb-6 shadow-2xl\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-center\">\n                        <div><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold highlight-gold\">10k+</p><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase\">Service Visits</p></div>\n                        <div><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold highlight-gold\">24/7</p><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase\">Emergency Fix</p></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-24\">\n\n        <!-- Introduction Section -->\n        <section class=\"prose max-w-none\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-900 border-b-4 border-orange-500 inline-block pb-2 mb-8 uppercase text-center w-full\">Expert air cooler repair services daman</h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                Is your cooling unit failing to beat the coastal humidity of Daman? Atlas Aircon provides specialized <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services daman</span> that are designed for high-performance evaporation. We understand the salt-heavy air in coastal towns like Nani Daman can cause rapid corrosion, and our technicians use specialized protective oils to keep your motors running longer.\n            </p>\n\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6\">\n                Our approach to <span class=\"highlight-gold\">air cooler repair services daman</span> involves deep sanitization and multi-stage testing. Whether it is a luxury desert cooler in a Devka resort or an industrial unit in Somnath GIDC, we ensure the pump, motor, and honeycomb pads are optimized for the highest possible cooling output.\n            </p>\n\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6\">\n                By choosing our <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services daman</span>, you receive the benefit of localized expertise and industrial-grade spare parts. We serve the entire territory from the historic streets of Moti Daman to the bustling industrial estates of Dabhel, ensuring no home or factory stays overheated this season.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- PRICING TABLE: ALL SPARE PARTS & RATES -->\n        <section>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-10 justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-500 p-3 rounded-full shadow-lg\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase\">Rates for air cooler repair services daman</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xl bg-white\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                    <thead class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white uppercase text-xs font-black\">\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Spare Part / Service</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Technical Role</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Rate (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"divide-y text-sm\">\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">General Service Visit</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">Deep cleaning and multi-point check</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹150</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">View List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">Heavy Duty Motor (Copper)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">Primary air projection motor</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹1,150</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/indoor-motor\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Buy Part</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">Submersible Water Pump</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">Pumping water to cooling pads</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹450</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/water-pump\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Buy Part</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">Premium Honeycomb Pads</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">High efficiency evaporation filter</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹950</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/honeycomb-pad\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Buy Part</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">Grass Wood Wool Filter</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">Traditional economical cooling</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹350</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/grass-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Buy Part</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">PCB Circuit Logic Repair</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">Remote and speed control system</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹850</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/pcb-circuit-repair\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Repair</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-500 mt-6 text-xs italic\">All prices for air cooler repair services daman are inclusive of standard installation.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- PROS AND CONS SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n            <div class=\"bg-emerald-50 p-10 rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-emerald-500 shadow-lg\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-emerald-900 mb-6 uppercase\">Benefits of Professional Service</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-tighter\">\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Increases life of <span class=\"highlight-orange\">copper motors</span> significantly.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Ensures <span class=\"highlight-gold\">100% germ-free air</span> via deep tank cleaning.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Prevents high electricity bills from jammed bearings.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Restores original airflow throw for <span class=\"highlight-orange\">desert coolers</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Eliminates bad odor caused by stagnant water.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Reduces noise for a peaceful sleep in Nani Daman homes.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Includes multi-point <span class=\"highlight-gold\">electrical safety checks</span>.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-rose-50 p-10 rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-rose-500 shadow-lg text-rose-900\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-6 uppercase\">Risks of Neglecting Repair</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter\">\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Total motor burnout due to <span class=\"highlight-orange\">dry running pumps</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Respiratory issues from <span class=\"highlight-gold\">mold-infested filters</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Dangerous short circuits in coastal humid conditions.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Permanent damage to the unit&#8217;s <span class=\"highlight-orange\">external body</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> High repair costs due to multiple component failure.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Extreme humidity and lack of cooling in mid-May.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Corroded wiring and <span class=\"highlight-gold\">faulty start capacitors</span>.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- INDUSTRIAL AREAS SECTION (DAMAN) -->\n        <section id=\"industrial-gidc\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase mb-8 text-center\">GIDC and Industrial air cooler repair services daman</h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                Daman is home to hundreds of manufacturing units that require constant cooling. Our industrial division specializes in maintaining high-capacity systems in the territory&#8217;s largest estates. We provide <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services daman</span> for pharmaceutical, plastic, and textile factories.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 text-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Somnath Industrial Estate</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Dabhel Industrial Area</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Bhimpore GIDC Cluster</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Kadaiya Industrial Park</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Dunetha Industrial Zone</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Bhimtalav Industrial</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Ringanwada GIDC</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Mashal Industrial Park</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Varkund Industrial Zone</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Kathiria GIDC Estate</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-center mt-8 text-gray-600 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold\">Nearby Reach: Vapi GIDC | Sarigam GIDC | Silvassa Industrial Hub</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- RESIDENTIAL AREAS SECTION (DAMAN) -->\n        <section id=\"residential-areas\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase mb-8 text-center\">Where We Serve In Daman</h2>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] text-gray-600 leading-loose uppercase font-bold justify-center max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n                Nani Daman | Moti Daman | Dabhel | Somnath | Kadaiya | Bhimpore | Dunetha | Marwad | Devka | Jampore | Varkund | Mashal Chowk | Dilip Nagar | Kathiria | Bhenslore | Pariyari | Magarwada | Patlara | Khariwad | Tin Batti | Seaface Road | Jetty Area | Airport Road | Fort Road.\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ERROR CODES SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"bg-amber-50 p-12 rounded-[3rem] border-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-amber-900 mb-8 uppercase text-center\">Troubleshooting for air cooler repair services daman</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-orange-500\">\n                    <p class=\"font-bold text-orange-600 mb-2 uppercase text-[10px]\">Problem: Salt Build-up on Pads</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Causes: Hard coastal water. Solution: <span class=\"highlight-orange\">deep descaling service</span> or replacement with <span class=\"highlight-gold\">premium honeycomb pads</span>.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-orange-500\">\n                    <p class=\"font-bold text-orange-600 mb-2 uppercase text-[10px]\">Problem: Motor Humming But No Rotation</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Causes: Dead capacitor or corroded bearings. Solution: Replace the <span class=\"highlight-gold\">start capacitor</span> or provide <span class=\"highlight-orange\">motor lubrication</span>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQ SECTION -->\n        <section id=\"faqs\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 mb-12 uppercase text-center\">FAQ: air cooler repair services daman</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">1. Do you provide doorstep air cooler repair services daman?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">Yes, we provide <span class=\"highlight-orange\">on-site repair</span> across Nani and Moti Daman, including all industrial GIDCs.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">2. How do you handle corrosion in coastal air coolers?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">We use <span class=\"highlight-gold\">anti-corrosion coatings</span> on motor shafts and electrical joints specifically for Daman&#8217;s saline environment.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">3. Can you fix high-capacity industrial coolers in Somnath?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">Yes, our <span class=\"highlight-orange\">industrial division</span> handles belt-driven fans and large-scale distribution units in Somnath and Dabhel.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">4. Why is my cooler making a loud grinding noise?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">This usually indicates <span class=\"highlight-gold\">bearing failure</span> in the motor or a loose fan blade. We provide immediate alignment and part replacement.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">5. What brands of coolers do you repair in Daman?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">We service all brands including <span class=\"highlight-orange\">Symphony, Bajaj, Crompton, and Orient</span> with genuine spare parts.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">6. How long do the cooling pads last in humid Daman?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">In coastal regions, <span class=\"highlight-gold\">honeycomb pads</span> last about 2-3 seasons with regular maintenance. Grass pads need yearly replacement.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">7. Do you provide emergency cooling service for resorts?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">Yes, we serve the <span class=\"highlight-orange\">hospitality sector</span> in Devka and Jampore with priority weekend support.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">8. My cooler pump is running but water is not flowing. Why?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">This indicates a blockage in the <span class=\"highlight-gold\">water distribution pipes</span> or a jammed impeller. We offer deep pipe descaling.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">9. Is the service visit chargeable?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">A nominal visit charge of <span class=\"highlight-orange\">₹150</span> is applicable, which is waived if you proceed with the repair.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\">10. Do you use copper or aluminum winding for motor repair?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase opacity-60\">We strictly use <span class=\"highlight-gold\">pure copper winding</span> for all repairs to ensure high heat resistance in Daman&#8217;s summers.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-950 text-white pt-20 pb-10\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" class=\"h-10 mb-6 filter brightness-0 invert mx-auto\" title=\"\">\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] opacity-70 uppercase font-black tracking-widest mb-4\">Leading air cooler repair services daman provider</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] opacity-30 uppercase font-black tracking-[0.5em]\">Atlas Aircon © 2026 &#8211; All Rights Reserved</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 bg-green-500 text-white p-4 rounded-full shadow-2xl z-[200] hover:scale-110 transition active:scale-95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.405c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.022 0-4.005-.515-5.756-1.492l-6.23 1.635zm6.757-4.102l.484.288c1.46.868 3.141 1.326 4.86 1.326 5.178 0 9.388-4.21 9.388-9.388 0-2.508-.976-4.866-2.748-6.639s-4.13-2.747-6.639-2.747c-5.178 0-9.388 4.21-9.388 9.388 0 1.88.556 3.714 1.608 5.289l.315.474-1.047 3.824 3.922-1.029zm9.515-5.525c-.278-.139-1.643-.81-1.897-.903-.255-.092-.441-.139-.626.139s-.719.903-.881 1.088-.324.208-.602.069c-.278-.139-1.175-.433-2.239-1.381-.827-.738-1.385-1.65-1.547-1.928-.162-.278-.017-.429.121-.566.125-.123.278-.324.417-.486.139-.162.185-.278.278-.463.093-.185.046-.347-.023-.486s-.626-1.505-.858-2.061c-.226-.549-.454-.472-.626-.481-.162-.008-.347-.01-.533-.01s-.486.069-.741.347c-.255.278-.973.949-.973 2.315s.996 2.686 1.135 2.871c.139.185 1.961 2.995 4.749 4.195.663.286 1.181.457 1.585.586.666.212 1.272.182 1.751.11.534-.08 1.643-.671 1.875-1.319.232-.648.232-1.204.162-1.319-.069-.115-.255-.185-.533-.324z\"/></svg>\n    </a>\n\n</div>",
